OL,4,G2200FNature Table
OL,5,     GJoin comedian and writer Sue
OL,6,     GPerkins as she hosts her award-
OL,7,     Gwinning comedy Nature Table: a
OL,8,     Gfunny show-and-tell series
OL,9,     Gcelebrating the natural world and
OL,10,     Gall its eccentricities.
OL,11,G2230FGoodness Gracious Me
OL,12,     GThe Archers and The Waltons with
OL,13,     Ga twist, and the Minx Twins
OL,14,     Gtackle feminism. Stars Sanjeev
OL,15,     GBhaskar. From June 1998.
OL,16,G2255FThe Comedy Club Interview
OL,17,     GFrom 10pm to midnight, seven
OL,18,     Gnights a week, The Comedy Club
OL,19,     Gbrings you two hours of the funny
OL,20,     Gstuff. Tonight, Eleanor Conway
OL,21,     Gchats once again to standup
OL,22,     Gcomedian Sarah Roberts.
